        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/lineville/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lineville’s iconic water tower, built in 1916, is now listed on Alabama’s historic landmarks register.",
